@startuml
[*] --> State
state "Order" as Order
state Arrival
state Preparation
state Operations
state Maintenance

Order --> Arrival : plane acquired
Arrival --> Preparation : arrival
Preparation --> Operations : assigned to operations or maintenance
Operations --> Maintenance : no scheduled flights or maintenance required
Maintenance --> Preparation : checked and serviced
Operations --> [*] : still has scheduled flights
Maintenance --> [*] : permanently withdrawn from service
Preparation --> Operations : assigned to operations
Order --> [*] : delivered

@enduml
